关，能在设置后立刻生效。（使用该技能来选择需要准备的陷阱。）\n\t\t并非所有陷阱都能这样准备，每个陷阱只能采用一种准备方式。\n\t\t已知可加装启动机关的陷阱：\n%s\n\n带有特殊启动机关的陷阱强度增加 %+d%% （取代陷阱专精的加成），有 %d%% 几率不破坏潜行。\n#YELLOW#当前选择的陷阱：%s#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ef9b236a79e9b566f1fa5852a70b78b40d6de2dcde7d92c24f885b0e762656ba","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"80fec08e0c4bfbace7b5dc7ba42dd92a008adedb0d7526ecbee2f0a6ae749d37","logical_entry_identity":"e7cdb955b632d580ffeda9b902878b66f73d5aa74e6d2d492aa2c72dee97dec5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"and fed to the hatchlings","source_tag":"_t","target":"并将其喂给幼龙们分食"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fe0fc1125bfb38eeccf07996808dfe8c297768ec2c52ad6fb70c9d8208842ac7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"81365342e78d5ad7fdc40a2c28e3c3beace54cf179fc6b8598bd065c97a4f9dc","logical_entry_identity":"aee3c69342147eac618a4421a7efae5e55ee086f24e8aa7234f6b9dbc90dfa3a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"and was savagely mutilated, a show of his rage towards all living things","source_tag":"_t","target":"并将其残忍肢解，以此宣泄他对一切生灵的怒火"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"80721f867794755fad5d057308f18e5fb84d534b000b1db0e3039c4d9f3b526c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8a5985f27087360369ad5c60f60365c8a2f78e59d8639ddb0bccd16def948fc2","logical_entry_identity":"652dfa390e1be7185288c13497f32ac07a38d0cfb46476903930703b2564b5b5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have learned to sing the praises of the Sun, in the form of three defensive Chants.\n\t\t\tChant of Fortitude: Increases your mental save by %d and maximum life by %d%%.\n\t\t\tChant of Fortress: Increases your physical save by %d, your physical resistance by %d%%, your armour by %d and your armour hardiness by 15%%.\n\t\t\tChant of Resistance: Increases you spell save by %d, your fire/cold/lightning/acid resistances by %d%% and reduces all damage that comes from distant enemies (3 spaces or more) by %d%%.\n\t\t\tYou may only have one Chant active at a time.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你学会了三种防御赞歌，以此咏唱对太阳的赞颂：\n\t\t\t坚韧赞歌：增加 %d 精神豁免， %d%% 最大生命值\n\t\t\t堡垒赞歌：增加 %d 物理豁免， %d%% 物理抗性， %d 护甲，15%% 护甲强度\n\t\t\t元素赞歌：增加 %d 法术豁免， %d%% 火焰 /寒冷 /闪电 /酸性抗性，减少距离三格及以上的敌人对你造成的伤害 %d%%。\n\t\t\t你同时只能激活一种赞歌。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cd3353e9af06a133f0ef75a67b23af37562982dd7c0d12e4d1782e5791c1664a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"92bfeae9b2c45b91a558d749cc0876531500daf3d41c6ac44013bd6df870e87a","logical_entry_identity":"caf22e92293c4e1f79f085aba941212892a05ddf486e0acd9c3a34fe0028b50e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"and a sole piece of char was sent to his masters as a totem","source_tag":"_t","target":"并只把一块焦炭作为信物送到了他的主人那里"},{"args_order":[1,2,3,4,6,7,5],"call_locator":"03ae4c556ff0bfe188971db3bd5caf956075f11a7f0a6199992754af6d01388f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"964b60d165d0a007fa8371110b0f06345ab82997fb193391b6fa52c8af56698a","logical_entry_identity":"f1ed0ba13d227c6530811c2fd1a595eda07ae244f852d0c8e071a3f8a813cfc9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s(%d %s %s) %s on %s %s.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%s(%d %s %s)在%s第%s层%s。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7fefdee4ccee393b57190edfc6005577536957f0484592fdae61d6d1bf8b6fd4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a1d91b07baa65db61e3db18dca51624edecdc8c7c14c2eaf13f8fddacfb4d3f3","logical_entry_identity":"7f3979ea3bd1989e0413b76472c6f534b775889cdea824177823d227ba052469","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"and vaporised into nothingness","source_tag":"_t","target":"并将其蒸发成虚无"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5eea56a42dd5a372c386fe97f7b931a7e8192213b1dbf6bfcb084c5ff2332815","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3532849bfb2a76e9d7568cd340d24c5e92e73576fea294033d1e5f1f69bcacc","logical_entry_identity":"f78092939d48636a28d021341cfde347a3dae08dcb1266da7b920032d0dc20f4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"and devoured as a demonic breakfast","source_tag":"_t","target":"并将其当作恶魔早餐吞噬"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2b